description: NEVER place adjacent buttons without margin; always use mr-2 on first button
globs: frontend/src/**/*.vue
alwaysApply: false
---

# Button Spacing (MANDATORY)

**Every pair of adjacent buttons MUST have spacing.** Add `class="mr-2"` to the first/left button.

```vue
<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<v-btn class="mr-2">Cancel</v-btn>
<v-btn color="primary">Save</v-btn>

<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<v-btn>Cancel</v-btn>
<v-btn>Save</v-btn>
```
